"Luna is a Wildling wolf girl, born a Lesser Shadow Pup in the Forest of Aeon west of Altracia."
"Luna has silver-black hair, golden eyes, wolf ears and tail; she speaks broken, third-person Common."
"Luna is a Velocity Reaper, Tier 1, level 21 of 25, of the Legendary path."
"Luna's skills include Shadow Step, Shadowmeld, Lunar Form, Devourer's Maw and Momentum Claw."
"Luna's trait Gluttonous Soul grows her by what she eats; spice poisons her wolf form."
"Luna loves spice, jerky and soup, calls the System a meanie, and calls Syliana her Second."
"This season Luna camps in the Vaelthorn Teeth with Syliana after killing an Elder Behemoth."
"Luna and Syliana are out of potions and mean to sell Behemoth parts at a northern town."
"Syliana is a silver-haired elf mage near level 68, scholar, alchemist, and Luna's guardian."
"Syliana holds A rank and trains Luna in magic, speech and restraint."
"Sepio, a gruff shield-bearer, leads their B-rank party; he now trains alone as a road guard."
"Ray, the party's coin-loving rogue, travels with Trianna gathering tools and news."
"Trianna, the party's teasing archer, travels with Ray to better her archery."
"Veric, the party's quiet swordsman, seeks a swordmaster to train under."
"The party split at Veyrfall Crossing, north of a western lakeland, to train for months."
"Ferric, Altracia's portly, gossiping Guildmaster, trusts his gut and stays in Altracia."
"Julia keeps Altracia's Guild desk; Derek guards its east gate and makes famous sandwiches."
"Grevan runs Altracia's best skewer stall; Dyran cooks for its Guild."
"Dorian, a fox beastkin, and Mister Bull lead Altracia's Proper Human Team; Flora is a healer."
"Luna's mother, baby sister and old pack still hunt the Forest of Aeon under a hostile alpha."
"A pale Duke secretly drives the Corruption plot and absorbs corruption through his bare hand."
"The Duke hunts the Wildling Luna; his Captain died trying to trap her at an old tower."
"Master Orthendal, a fleshcrafter under the Duke, makes chimeras in a hidden lab."
"Orthendal keeps a many-headed pet hydra; his student is a corrupted arch-lich."
"Orthendal pulls out of his northern region this season and plans a trap for Luna."
"Corruption cells hide under waystation taverns, move glowing reagents and answer to Magisters."
"Every cell holds orders to watch for a silver-black Wildling wolf girl and report her route."
"Darvin, a corrupted agent, carries the Corruption in his body and watched Luna in Altracia."
"A cult under an old northern shrine, led by Mother Vaelis, gives blood to the Lords beyond."
"The cult's Lords wait past a boundary the cult tries to thin; they hate the Corrupt."
"A colossal black serpent sleeps under the Velssarin ruins in the Forest of Aeon."
"Pilgrims up north now tell of a Divine Child of the Wilds under the Moon."
